      "uid": "zhcn:8771afc9e0854b135f953305",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很抱歉，\n我太晚才察觉，指尖不小心碰到了。\n麻烦教练确认是否还正常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6539717c912dccb9bff85acb2508473516ecbcfe1ba3fe556ab52d6ccbd3a056",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
