      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁没有再多说什么，\n只是静静地替我擦去脸上的脏污。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7d035b5b4093276ab5a3e11a514e14282f12acebe5831e024d4a239c8e56db",
