      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这么一说，\n我想起美浦波旁只要接触机器，\n就有很高几率导致机器故障。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60bff49fa9e11cbeb510c03fe969d305116bb51b269d82c1eba55f6b876cb277",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
