      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果能让她接触后不造成故障，\n就算是一起克服了难关，\n或许就能成为“重要的回忆”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8dcdd9797b8de88664c1e4ad606dd5721baa7743d7e6fbbbad50b94e0dbe67e",
